User Story:\n1. **Persona & Goal (`As a... I want... So that...`):** Clear business value and actor context.\n2. **Technical Details & System Adapters:** Explicit endpoint routes, timeout budgets, and state handling.\n3. **Data Contracts:** Schemas for the `X-Authenticated-User` signed JWT, `Idempotency-Key` headers, and API error envelopes.\n4. **Edge Cases & Failure Recovery:** Behavior during upstream 5xx outages, weekend exclusions, and duplicate submissions.\n5. **Gherkin Acceptance Criteria:** Complete `Given-When-Then` test scenarios ready for QA automation and developer testing.\n\n---\n\n### Complete Deliverables Reference:\n* 📄 **Revised & Approved BRD (Clean):** [HR Agentic Solution BRD (MVP 1 - Revised & Approved)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gW-lwRWN1sltc0jUolYhFktNlzJ3App5d7z4AkivZlI/edit)\n* 📝 **BRD with Tracked Changes & Comments:** [HR Agentic Solution BRD - With Tracked Changes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4/edit)\n* 🚀 **Functional Specifications & Agile User Stories:** [HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit)","truncated_fields":["content"]}
