d)\\\"]\\n        \\n        InputGuard -->|2. Clean Prompt| Orchestrator\\n        Orchestrator <--> SessionMgr\\n        Orche\n<truncated 15070 bytes>","Description":"\"Create architecture and workflow diagrams markdown file with Mermaid diagrams\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/architecture_diagrams.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing architecture diagrams to markdown file\"","toolSummary":"\"Write architecture diagrams markdown\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
