ateway\n27:     end\n28: \n29:     subgraph Security_Layer [\"3. Interaction Safety & Governance\"]\n30:         InputGuard[\"Input Safety Guardrail\\n(Prompt Injection & Jailbreak Filter)\"]\n31:         OutputGuard[\"Outpu\n<truncated 15044 bytes>\nIllustrates how static HR documents are chunked, embedded, and kept synchronized within the $\\le 1\\text{ hour}$ SLA.\n384: \n385: ```mermaid\n386: flowchart TD\n387:     subgraph Source_Repo [\"1. HR Policy Document Source\"]\n388:         Repo[(\"Central Document Store\\n(PDF / DOCX / Markdown)\")]\n389:         Admin[\"HR Admin / Policy Owner\"]\n390:         Admin -->|Uploads / Edits Document| Repo\n391:     end\n392: \n393:     subgraph Trigger_Layer [\"2. Ingestion Triggers\"]\n394:         Webhook[\"CDC Event / Webhook\\n(Instant Trigger)\"]\n395:         ManualSync[\"Admin Endpoint\\nPOST /rag/sync\"]\n396:         CronSync[\"Nightly Batch Cron\\n(02:00 UTC)\"]\n397:         \n398:         Repo -->|File Change Detected| Webhook\n399:         Admin -.->|Manual Override| ManualSync\n400:     end\n401: \n402:     subgraph Processing_Pipeline [\"3. Chunking & Embedding Engine\"]\n403:         Parser[\"Document Parser\\n(Extracts Headings, Tables & Text)\"]\n404:         Chunker[\"Semantic Chunker\\n(512 Tokens, 50-Token Overlap)\"]\n405:         Embedder[\"Embedding Generator\\n(Generates Dense Vectors)\"]\n406:         \n407:         Webhook --> Parser\n408:         ManualSync --> Parser\n409:         CronSync --> Parser\n410:         Parser --> Chunker\n411:         Chunker --> Embedder\n412:     end\n413: \n414:     subgraph Vector_Storage [\"4. Policy Knowledge Base\"]\n415:         VectorIndex[(\"Vector DB Index\\n(Embeddings & Metadata)\")]\n416:         OldIndex[\"Stale Chunks Invalidation\\n(Hash-Based Purge)\"]\n417:         \n418:         Embedder --> OldIndex\n419:         OldIndex --> VectorIndex\n420:     end\n421: \n422:     subgraph Query_Service [\"5. Retrieval Layer\"]\n423:         SearchAPI[\"Similarity Search API\\n(Cosine Distance, k=4, Threshold >= 0.70)\"]\n424:         VectorIndex <--> SearchAPI\n425:     end\n426: \n427:     style Webhook fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#03a9f4;\n428:     style VectorIndex fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50;\n429:     style OldIndex fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800;\n430: ```\n431: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
