ts/skills/vcs/SKILL.md): Manage version control in Google3/Piper workspaces using Fig (hg), jj (Jujutsu), or Piper (g4). Covers workspace setup, commits, CL lifecycle (u\n<truncated 785 bytes>\nss Workspace corpora.\n- filesystems (/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/learning/gemini/agents/skills/filesystems/SKILL.md): Covers how to read or manage files for internal Google filesystems: /cns/, /x20/, /tfhub/, /google_src/. Explains how to use `fileutil` from the command line and the `gfile` API from code. A **MUST READ** before accessing any of these filesystems.\n- drive_folders (/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/apps/intelligence/gen_ai/control_plane/shared/skills_repository/skills/drive_folders/1/SKILL.md): Use when creating folders, setting up project directory structures, or moving files into folders in Google Drive. Don't use for searching Drive files, reading document contents, downloading files, or editing Google Docs, Sheets, or Slides content.\n- drive-folders (/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/apps/intelligence/gen_ai/control_plane/shared/skills_repository/skills/drive_folders/experimental_mcp/SKILL.md): Use when creating folders, setting up project directory structures, or moving files into folders in Google Drive. Don't use for searching Drive files, reading document contents, downloading files, or editing Google Docs, Sheets, or Slides content.\n- drive_folders (/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/learning/agents/orcas/chiliagon/agents/sobi/skills/google-drive/SKILL.md): Use when creating folders, setting up project directory structures, or moving files into folders in Google Drive. Don't use for searching Drive files, reading document contents, downloading files, or editing Google Docs, Sheets, or Slides content.\n- capsule (/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/learning/gemini/agents/skills/capsule/SKILL.md): How to provision,